              <p class="md-body-medium text-on-surface-variant">
                <strong>Cause.</strong> <code>build()</code> returns{' '}
                <a href="/docs/api/validator">an object with four members</a>, not a function.
                1.x's README showed it being called; no implementation ever returned something
                callable.
              </p>
              <CodeBlock code={buildCallableExample} language="typescript" invalid />
            </div>
