              <p class="md-body-medium text-on-surface-variant">
                <strong>Cause.</strong> The default code is the <strong>plugin's name</strong>,
                with <code>options.code</code> overriding it.
              </p>
              <div class="overflow-x-auto">
                <table class="w-full min-w-[32rem] text-left">
                  <thead>
                    <tr class="border-b border-outline">
                      <th class="md-title-small py-2 pr-4">Rule</th>
                      <th class="md-title-small py-2 pr-4">1.x code</th>
                      <th class="md-title-small py-2">Now</th>
                    </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody class="md-body-medium text-on-surface-variant">
                    <tr class="border-b border-outline-variant">
                      <td class="py-2 pr-4"><code>.required()</code></td>
                      <td class="py-2 pr-4"><code>REQUIRED</code></td>
                      <td class="py-2"><code>required</code></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr class="border-b border-outline-variant">
                      <td class="py-2 pr-4"><code>.min(3)</code> on a string</td>
                      <td class="py-2 pr-4"><code>VALIDATION_ERROR</code> family</td>
                      <td class="py-2"><code>stringMin</code></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr class="border-b border-outline-variant">
                      <td class="py-2 pr-4"><code>.custom(fn)</code></td>
                      <td class="py-2 pr-4"><code>VALIDATION_ERROR</code></td>
                      <td class="py-2"><code>custom</code></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td class="py-2 pr-4"><code>.orFail(fn)</code></td>
                      <td class="py-2 pr-4"><code>VALIDATION_ERROR</code></td>
                      <td class="py-2"><code>orFail</code></td>
                    </tr>
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details id="message-option" class="not-prose md-card md-card-outlined mb-6 p-6" open>
            <summary class="md-title-medium flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2">
              <span class="summary-marker md-icon md-icon-sm" aria-hidden="true"
                >expand_more</span
              >
              <span class="min-w-0 break-words"
                ><code>&#123; message: "…" &#125;</code> is not accepted on a rule</span
