            <div class="mt-4 space-y-4">
              <p class="md-body-medium text-on-surface-variant">
                <strong>Cause.</strong> There is one message channel:{' '}
                <code>messageFactory</code>. <code>RuleOptions</code> is{' '}
                <code>&#123; code?, messageFactory?, severity? &#125;</code> and nothing else, and
                it is always the <strong>last</strong> argument of a chain method, after the
                plugin's own.
              </p>
